              "backgroundVideo": null,
              "backgroundVideoMobile": null
            },
            "c2a": null,
            "verticalScroller": null
          },
          {
            "text": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Regenerative design is a process that seeks to identify and activate the unique potential of each system, whether a territory, an organization or a community. We have developed a process in \"Design in Bioregional Permaculture\", and we work with regenerative frameworks that allow us to explore the history, dynamics and capabilities of the site, understanding it as a living organism in evolution. Our approach integrates the active participation of the community in all processes, helping them become active and sustainable agents of change.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Creation of regenerative stories:",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " We facilitate the design of deep stories that connect the essential values of the community or organization with an integrative perspective that works from the entire systems (Whole Systems Design).",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Regenerative systems design:",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " We accompany the design of economic initiatives, policies and governance structures that operate from respect and regeneration of social and natural ecosystems using the framework of the \"Sociocracy 3.0\".",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Support in the development of capabilities:",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " We offer training and accompaniment to develop internal capabilities in communities and organizations to manage their own regenerative processes independently and effectively.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "title": null,
            "titleHeading": null,
