                "type": "heading",
                "level": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Cocreative design.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "title": null,
            "titleHeading": null,
            "alias": "column 1",
            "media": null,
            "styles": {
              "cssClass": "col-md-5 h3-fw-500",
              "height": null,
              "textColor": "dark",
              "margin": null,
              "padding": "0 50px 0 0",
              "background": null,
              "width": null,
              "sectionId": null,
              "backgroundColor": null,
              "container": null,
              "paddingTop": null,
              "paddingBottom": null,
              "listenAudioBefore": null,
              "listenAudioAfter": null,
              "backgroundImage": null,
              "backgroundImage2": null,
              "backgroundVideo": null,
              "backgroundVideoMobile": null
            },
            "c2a": null,
            "verticalScroller": null
          },
          {
            "text": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The co-creative design we offer at Resilience.Earth allows organizations and communities to design strategies and solutions in a collaborative and inclusive way. We use innovative methodologies such as Jenny McKewn's \"cocreative facilitation\" and systemic mapping to identify key points of change and activate synergies among the various actors involved. We accompany the design of incubators and accelerators of projects that promote social and environmental transformation, creating co-creation spaces that unite culture, economy and nature to generate a deep and lasting impact.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Cocreative facilitation:",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " We design and provide participatory and inclusive spaces where different actors can identify and co-create solutions that respond to their specific purposes and needs.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Incubators and project accelerators:",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " We help to design structures that allow the management of regenerative projects, connecting ideas with specific resources and knowledge to scale and consolidate them.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "bold": true,
                    "text": "Accompaniment in the creation of regenerative models:",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " We guide the design processes of regenerative economic, social and cultural models that encourage long-term cooperation and well-being.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
